## Image and Video
### Screenshots
```
 /console screenshotFormat png
```

### Using two screens with the WoW window maximised on the secondary monitor (Work around)
```
tell application "World of Warcraft" to activate
tell application "System Events" to tell process "World of Warcraft"
	tell window 1
		set position to {-1680, 0}
	end tell
end tell
```

## "Dual-Boxing" on one Mac
### Hybrid Approach "How-To"
```
/Users/YourName/wowcopy.sh
```

